pip install faker, requests

Main test scenario
1. Register non admin user               -> POST request
2. Login with registered non admin user  -> POST request 
3. Add account balance                   -> POST request
4. Check that account balance is correct -> GET request

- data.py - test data
- endpoints.py - all endpoints

test cases
Register_user.py -      Register new non admin user
nonadmin_login.py -     Login with the created non admin user
add_balance.py -        Adding account balance
checking_balance.py -   Check that account balance is correct

